>>
endobj
640 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (The Industrial Shields Family PLCs are Open Type Controllers. It is required that you install the Ardbox family PLC in a housing, cabinet, or electric control room. Entry to the housing, cabinet, or electric control room should be limited to authorized personnel.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [40]
>>
endobj
641 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
