/Pg 13 0 R
/K [45]
>>
endobj
646 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (This equipment does not include galvanic isolation between the grounds of the different systems. This means that if an external device or sensor that shares the same ground reference \(GND\) with the system is connected, any potential difference between these grounds could damage the connected components. To avoid issues with interference, ground loops, or damage to external equipment, ensure that all connected devices share the same ground reference or use systems with appropriate isolation. The recommendations in this case are:)
/Pg 13 0 R
